    "detailed_description": "MULTIPLAYER OBBY - A Fun Obstacle Course Race Party Game. Make your way across moving platforms, jump pads, rotating beams and bridges that suddenly open, and More.<br />\r\nThe first player to pick up the trophy is the winner!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game includes a Single Player OR Multiplayer system.<br />\r\nCompatible with Steam online subsystem.<br />\r\nYou can Invite Your Steam Friends with the ' + ' Icon on the Main Lobby Screen!<br />\r\nTested online with clients under server-load. <br />\r\n* NOTE : You should have a Stable &amp; Fast Internet Connection for Best Results *<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt features all the necessary content needed to provide the Player with the best user and gameplay experience, such as a unique 3D environment, GUI design, and fun gameplay mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Game is packed with action and many more features listed below . . .<br />\r\nFun Gameplay<br />\r\nMain menu<br />\r\nCheckpoint respawn system<br />\r\nNames above player heads (when within certain distance of each other)<br />\r\nChat Function in the Game Lobby<br />\r\nIn-game Pause Menu (Continue, Leave game, Settings, Quit game)<br />\r\nSettings menu (Window mode, Resolution, Graphics quality, Audio Volume)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a fun social multiplayer game in which you can play the obstacle course together with your friends, or also Single Player.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe obstacle course is challenging, satisfying, colorful, and fun to play.<br />\r\nMake your way across challenging obstacles and be the first to reach the finish.<br />\r\nThe game includes checkpoints where you can respawn in case you fall or die.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChallenge Yourself OR Invite Your Steam Friends for a Party Game.",
